@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam MaxMessageSize 150

actor "Engenheiro de QA" as QA
participant "Interface React\n(App)" as Web
participant "authServer\n(Core API, Go)" as Core
participant "PoolController" as Ctrl
participant "Runner\n(pool de UsuarioVirtual)" as Runner

QA -> Web: Ajustar concorrência/chaos\nou Pausar/Retomar/Finalizar
activate Web
Web -> Core: POST /test/control | /test/pause | /test/resume | /test/stop
activate Core
Core -> Ctrl: Atualiza estado de controle\n(concorrência, chaos, pausa)
Core --> Web: 200 OK
deactivate Core

loop A cada ~1s, enquanto o teste roda
    Runner -> Ctrl: Lê estado de controle atual
    activate Runner
    Runner -> Runner: Ajusta o pool (adiciona/remove VUs),\naplica chaos e pausa a permanência
    deactivate Runner
end

opt Finalizar teste (/test/stop)
    Core -> Runner: Cancela a execução
    Core -> Web: broadcast 'test_stopped' (WebSocket)
end
deactivate Web
@enduml
